[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6218465784","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2578#issuecomment-6218465784","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2578","id":6218465784,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABcqZB-A","user":{"login":"ggbdpq","id":67929842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTI5ODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67929842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq","html_url":"https://github.com/ggbdpq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T15:09:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T15:09:23Z","body":"我来分析确认一下。已对照 main（1d6f461a）核了 `internal/gateway/desktop.go` 的 `claudeLooking`/`desktopModels` 与 `internal/agent/claudedesktop.go` 的接管写入链，正在把「display_name 已正确返回但菜单仍显示别名」定性为 magpie 侧可修还是 Desktop 端限制，稍后贴结论。","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6218465784/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6218481428","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2578#issuecomment-6218481428","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2578","id":6218481428,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABcqZ_FA","user":{"login":"ggbdpq","id":67929842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTI5ODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67929842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq","html_url":"https://github.com/ggbdpq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T15:10:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T15:10:12Z","body":"**结论：这是 Claude Desktop 端的限制，不是 magpie 侧还能修的**——网关侧能给的（正确的 `display_name`）已经给了，剩余差距出在 Desktop 对「能折进它自家签名目录的 id」的名称覆盖上。[#1746 合入时的说明](https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/1746#issuecomment-6133258946) 已把这条列为已知客户端限制（\"id 看起来像 Claude 自家模型的（比如 Opus 5.5），Desktop 会用它自己目录里的名字显示，网关这边改不了\"），本 issue 是它在「两个供应商的同一个 Claude 模型」场景下的具体呈现。\n\n**根因链**（对照 main `1d6f461a` 核过）：\n\n1. 菜单内容不是 magpie 写进 Desktop 配置的。magpie 只写 3p `deploymentMode` 和 gateway profile（`internal/agent/claudedesktop.go` 头注释）；没有 `inferenceModels` 时 Desktop 列的是网关 `/v1/models`，菜单是 Desktop 启动时自拉的。`display_name` 已走 `desktopNames` → `provider.Labels`（#1746），你核对到的响应也证实了这点。\n2. 覆盖发生在 Desktop 侧：对有推理档位的原生 Claude 模型，`claudeLooking`（`internal/gateway/desktop.go`）必须列成 `magpie-<n>.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5`——Desktop（app.asar 2.7032 的 tIt/IC/HFt 链）剥掉 `<profile>.anthropic.` 前缀后按 `claude-opus-5-5` 查它的签名目录给 per-model effort 档位，**同时用目录名（\"Opus 5.5\"）替代行名、无视 `display_name`**；两行折进同一目录名时 Desktop 再拿 id 片段加括号区分，就是你看到的「数字哈希 + `.anthropic.claude-opus-5-5` 后缀」。无档位的 Sonnet 走原样 id，同样被目录名覆盖成 \"Sonnet 5.5\"。\n\n**为什么 magpie 侧剩下的路都走不通**（不想硬凑）：\n\n1. **id 形态被 effort 语义锁死**。改用 `mythos-magpie-<n>` 通配别名确实能让 `display_name` 露出来，但档位会换成通配表：thinking 强制常开、没有 off、丢 per-model 档位，且 Code tab 不再认得这个模型（unrecognized_model）——与期望 #3「保留 reasoning effort 语义」直接冲突。\n2. **供应商名进 id 撞厂商词雷区**。Desktop 的网关检查会拒绝 id 里含 deepseek / kimi / glm / gpt / grok 等几十个厂商词中任何一个的模型，且词表随版本增长——供应商名一旦撞词，模型会**整条从菜单消失**，比现在更糟。别名用 10 位数字哈希而不是可读名，正是为了「id 里不给它任何厂商词」。\n3. **两个未验证的杠杆不能当修复交付**。`description` 字段和 `inferenceModels[].labelOverride` 对「目录折叠行」是否生效都没在真实 UI 验证过：目录行是否仍附加网关行的 description、labelOverride 能否盖过目录名，都是未知。而自动维护 `inferenceModels` 还会把现在「Desktop 启动时动态拉 `/v1/models`」的机制冻结成静态列表。你把「验证覆盖真实 Desktop 菜单」列为验收条件是合理的——这两条必须先在真实 Desktop（双供应商同模型）环境验证有效，才值得由 magpie 自动维护。\n\n**眼下的缓解**：\n\n- 菜单括号里的 10 位数字是该模型 magpie id 的 FNV 哈希（`aliasNumber`），同一模型稳定不变，认一次即可固定区分；Claude Code CLI 的 `/model` 不受影响（走的是 `display_name`），与你观察一致。\n- 某段时间只用一家时，可在 magpie 的 Claude Desktop 行的模型多选里只勾当前用的那家，菜单就只剩一个条目、无歧义。\n\n要不要试 `description`/`labelOverride` 这条路，建议由维护者拍板：若试，先在真实 Desktop（双供应商同模型）确认这两个字段对目录折叠行是否生效，再决定 magpie 是否自动维护。\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6218481428/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6218545448","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2578#issuecomment-6218545448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2578","id":6218545448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABcqd5KA","user":{"login":"jerrychoi","id":138487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODQ4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi","html_url":"https://github.com/jerrychoi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T15:13:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T15:13:38Z","body":"那菜单括号里的 10 位数字是否可以在magpie中合适的位置也显示出来，这样可以直接在app的供应商页面直观的看到，从而能明确知道在 Claude Desktop 中用的是哪家？","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6218545448/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6219827729","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2578#issuecomment-6219827729","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2578","id":6219827729,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABcrsKEQ","user":{"login":"jerrychoi","id":138487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODQ4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi","html_url":"https://github.com/jerrychoi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T16:20:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T16:20:16Z","body":"应该是可以建议在供应商中每个供应商的名字后边把这个内部id显示上去，建议考虑下","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6219827729/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6223711558","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2578#issuecomment-6223711558","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2578","id":6223711558,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABcvZNRg","user":{"login":"ggbdpq","id":67929842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTI5ODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67929842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq","html_url":"https://github.com/ggbdpq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T20:05:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T20:05:33Z","body":"可以,按这个方向做。一个澄清:这串编号是按「模型」算的(菜单括号里对应的是某一个模型),同一个供应商可能有多个模型、各自有各自的编号,所以打算放在供应商页面每个模型的行上(而不是供应商名字后面),这样菜单里看到哪一行的编号,回来就能对上是哪家供应商的哪个模型。正在改,好了会贴出来。","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6223711558/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6224132617","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2578#issuecomment-6224132617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2578","id":6224132617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABcvy6CQ","user":{"login":"ggbdpq","id":67929842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTI5ODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67929842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq","html_url":"https://github.com/ggbdpq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-16T20:30:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T20:30:56Z","body":"做好了,接着上面的方向:@jerrychoi 编号已经显示在供应商页面上了。\n\n**显示在哪**:每个供应商编辑器里「模型」列表的每个模型小片(chip)上,多一枚小号数牌,比如 `3233491987`——就是 Claude Desktop 菜单括号里的那串数;鼠标悬停会说明它的含义。编号按「模型」算:同一供应商的多个模型各有各的号,Desktop 把两家同名模型折成一行时,括号里的号对上这里对应模型片上的牌,用的哪家一目了然。\n\n**什么时候没有号**:这串号只存在于 Desktop 被给的「别名」id 里——Desktop 直接用模型自己的 id 时(比如没有推理档的 Claude 模型按原 id 列出),或模型没有开放给 Desktop 时,行上就没有牌;这两种情况下菜单本来也没有括号里的号,两边仍然对得上。号由网关侧统一计算(`gateway.DesktopNumber`,即菜单 id 里的 `aliasNumber`),前端没有第二套哈希,不存在算不一致的可能。\n\n**验证**(macOS arm64,Go 版本按 go.mod 工具链,测试在临时 HOME 沙盒):\n- 后端:新增 `TestProviderModelsSayDesktopNumber`——改前红(`the page says desktop <nil>, want \"3233491987\"`),改后绿;`TestDesktopNumber` 锁住四种 id 形态的取号规则(effort Claude 模型、其它带档模型、普通别名、模型自身 id)。\n- 前端:新增 Playwright 测试 `model-desktop-number.test.cjs`——旧 app.js 下 4/4 红(Chromium/WebKit × en/zh),改后 4/4 绿;触及同一段渲染的既有测试(models-fold、models-free-only、model-rate、model-copy-id、model-kind、provider-none-picked)也全绿;悬停文案四语言齐全(简体、繁體、日本語、Deutsch),i18n-keys 过。\n- `go test -tags nogui ./...` 全量:65 包 ok;唯一失败 `TestProxyCheckSaysAProxyPassedBy` 在干净的 upstream/main(72d6103e)上单跑同样失败,是 main 上的预存问题(假代理收到 0 次请求、报 HTTP 502),与本次改动无关,未在此处理。\n- `gofmt -l` 干净;三平台 `go vet` 与三平台 `go build` 过;app.js 字节预算测试过(1,248,015 / 1,250,000)。\n\n**请维护者裁量**:显示位置现在是模型片上的小数牌(复用现有 badge 样式,零新增 CSS);若想改成行内小字或别的位置,调整成本很小。分支已推到 fork,愿意收的话可以直接开 PR 或叫我开:https://github.com/ggbdpq/magpie/tree/hunt/2578b-alias-display (顶提交 dcb00beb,基于 upstream/main 72d6103e)。没写 `Fixes`——本 issue 前面的定性(菜单名称覆盖是 Desktop 端限制)仍然成立,这次落地的是报告者建议的「编号对照」这一面,关单与否请维护者定。\n\nPrepared with AI assistance (GLM-5.3-Flash via ZCode); every check above was executed locally.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6224132617/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6230020085","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2578#issuecomment-6230020085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2578","id":6230020085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABc1aP9Q","user":{"login":"yetone","id":1206493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDY0OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1206493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-17T05:12:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T05:12:31Z","body":"On main in 7660399a1, in the next release. Thanks @ggbdpq for the patch, and @jerrychoi for the screenshots.\n\nWhen Claude Desktop is installed, a provider's model chip in its editor now shows the number Desktop's menu shows beside that model, as a small muted badge after the context size.\n\nIt's narrower than the patch, on purpose. Desktop names a row by our display name (which already says the provider), except when the id resolves into its own catalog. That's the `magpie-<number>.anthropic.<model>` form magpie gives a Claude model with reasoning levels, so that Desktop keeps its effort picker. Those rows are named after Desktop's catalog (\"Opus 5.5\"), and the number is the only thing that tells two providers apart. So the badge shows only:\n- while Claude Desktop is installed;\n- on a model Desktop is shown (not one hidden from it);\n- on a Claude model listed in that form.\n\nEvery other model gets no number in Desktop's menu, so it gets no badge here either. That includes Sonnet listed by its own id, which matches your screenshot: Desktop shows it by its catalog name with no number, and we can't change that from our side.\n\nIt hasn't been tried with a real Desktop and two providers serving one model. Leaving this open for @jerrychoi to confirm.\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6230020085/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6235483562","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2578#issuecomment-6235483562","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2578","id":6235483562,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABc6ntqg","user":{"login":"yetone","id":1206493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDY0OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1206493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-17T15:06:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:06:32Z","body":"这个修复已经在 [v0.1.1280](https://github.com/yetone/magpie/releases/tag/v0.1.1280) 发布了，更新后可以再试试。issue 先开着，等你确认没问题了再关；还有问题就直接在这里说。\n\nThe fix is out in v0.1.1280. Please update and try again. This stays open until you confirm it works for you.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6235483562/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6235833331","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/2578#issuecomment-6235833331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/2578","id":6235833331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABc69D8w","user":{"login":"jerrychoi","id":138487,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODQ4Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138487?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi","html_url":"https://github.com/jerrychoi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jerrychoi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-17T15:33:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:33:37Z","body":"没问题了，多谢佬。","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6235833331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]